      "post_id": "544344771796295680",
      "text": "@JonnyPut @Uber_Sydney how about you fuck off back to your corner of the internet where your opinion matters and I'll do the same.",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 04:14:41 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.4434283911132774e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544364547574726656",
      "text": "@Uber_Sydney @DrYobbo @COMINT_AU @alfinitum Well that's not true. First, you tweeted an explanation about why you were gouging customers.",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 05:33:16 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.443641503196119e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544330529529548801",
      "text": "@Uber_Sydney thank you for fixing this situation.",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 03:18:06 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.443299359432376e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544348155752370177",
      "text": "“@Uber_Sydney: @nicholasderoose Uber trips out of the CBD today are free to help Sydneysiders get home safely. See http://t.co/q8P16Am0QU”",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 04:28:08 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.44346902439809e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544353316998631424",
      "text": "@Mr_Odin @JonnyPut surge pricing is automated. When we became aware of the situation we capped surge pricing and made rides free for riders.",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 04:48:39 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.443438900864696e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544349254706155520",
      "text": "@Uber_Sydney @Mr_Odin Yeah, I got that. Thank you for your great service.",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 04:32:30 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.443489864846131e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544348496728309760",
      "text": "@COMINT_AU @Uber_Sydney @DrYobbo at least they're righting a wrong. I'll grant them that.",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 04:29:29 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.4434810016526336e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544346902439809024",
      "text": "@nicholasderoose Uber trips out of the CBD today are free to help Sydneysiders get home safely. See http://t.co/UIwoom25Bm",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 04:23:09 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.4433040639737446e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544330709918183425",
      "text": "@Uber_Sydney you really gotta stop the swarm model or at least have someone actually look at WHY an area is swarming.",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 03:18:49 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.443299359432376e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544347330166530049",
      "text": "@el1nor Uber is covering the cost of all rides.",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 04:24:51 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.443311065818972e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544330593228840961",
      "text": "@Uber_Sydney that's like the most confusing statement ever. The social media department of Uber Sydney is high or something?",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 03:18:21 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.443299359432376e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544339757195489281",
      "text": "@EnglishEmma You called uber public transport, it's not. PT is for everyone not just the elite.",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 03:54:46 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.4433946626597274e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544342570151579650",
      "text": "@life19082492084 Same people pro do sweet all but moan on social media about how terrible everyone else is.. And yes irony burning my end.",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 04:05:56 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.443420761129042e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544354334348029952",
      "text": "@DrYobbo @alfinitum Uber is covering the cost of all rides, Uber is still paying drivers higher fares to encourage them to pickup riders.",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 04:52:41 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.4433179025342874e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544351211403505666",
      "text": "@Uber_Sydney @EnglishEmma @universe93 Only after #worldwide backlash. Kinda like getting your hand caught in the cookie jar. #amirite ?",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 04:40:17 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.443508063008481e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544346925118394368",
      "text": "@Umair_Bilal Uber trips out of the CBD today are free to help Sydneysiders get home safely. See http://t.co/UIwoom25Bm",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 04:23:15 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.4433059322884096e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544339277749182464",
      "text": ".@harrytuckerr No, you refused to pay for them to be at the phones. Enjoy your walk. @Uber_Sydney",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 03:52:51 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.443305961980191e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544337927132569601",
      "text": "@EnglishEmma @universe93 Taxis all offer $30 discount to disabled passengers, #uber doesnt even have disabled taxis to offer. That's true PT",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 03:47:29 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.4433757914373734e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544332086937546752",
      "text": "@DrYobbo initial message did imply that riders can cop hike. Much better. @Uber_Sydney",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 03:24:17 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.4433179025342874e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544347707981041664",
      "text": "@GRQconsultants Uber trips out of the CBD today are free to help Sydneysiders get home safely. See http://t.co/UIwoom25Bm",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 04:26:21 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.443316632419082e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544336306437128192",
      "text": "@andrewv @Uber_Sydney the surge rates are to draw the drivers there (uber will pay the cost). No fee to passengers.",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 03:41:03 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.4433161581234586e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544337315124875264",
      "text": "@bmac_ottawa @Uber_Sydney didn't make it very clear in the beginning.",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 03:45:03 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.4433607987759514e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544348986484613120",
      "text": "@JonnyPut @Mr_Odin Uber is covering the cost of all rides, Uber is still paying drivers higher fares to encourage them to pickup riders.",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 04:31:26 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.443332882491187e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544331421494423552",
      "text": "@EnglishEmma it's still raising prices when people are trying to leave the CBD in a crisis. At least they've made rides free now",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 03:21:38 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.4433115399429734e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544344866285576193",
      "text": "@Mr_Odin @Uber_Sydney Listen up dum-dum.  They ARE paying the drivers more. Reading is a skill.",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 04:15:04 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.443438900864696e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544347329416151040",
      "text": "@Uber_Sydney What is the wait time for a ride out of the Sydney CBD? @iGottaTravel @mtats",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 04:24:51 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.4434705575419904e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544334052526784512",
      "text": "@nicholasderoose @Uber_Sydney you're aware that this tweet ...is giving away free rides, right?",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 03:32:06 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.4433040639737446e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544331615812345856",
      "text": "@Uber_Sydney so free or surge pricing? #confused",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 03:22:25 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.443299359432376e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544331338317565953",
      "text": "that's better RT @Uber_Sydney: Uber Sydney trips from CBD will be free for riders. Higher rates still in place to encourage drivers",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 03:21:18 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.443299359432376e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544339466265972736",
